      "heading": "1 · Make it rough, make it early",
      "sentence": "A rough prototype is a question in material form. Make the smallest version that can teach you something.",
      "quote": "A rough thing can answer a question that a polished thing hides.",
      "quote_origin": "tao_invented",
      "citation": {
