      "heading": "2 · Defer judgement",
      "sentence": "Protect a short space for variation before you decide what works. Then judge with a named criterion.",
      "image_brief": "Beethoven's sketchbook for the Seventh Symphony, 1812: themes tried in several versions before any is judged final — a protected space for variation before decision.",
